<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD" ;
  triage:title "Underlying io::Error discarded on unexpected accept/bind/dir failures, collapsing distinct OS errors into one generic message" ;
  triage:description "Rust-best-practices-agent on QA-1 found this discard pattern (Err(_source) =>, etc., dropping the underlying io::Error) at 4 sites: local_ipc_transport.rs:972 (unexpected accept() failure, important), local_ipc_transport.rs:487 (bind failure, minor), shutdown.rs:110 (dir creation, minor), shutdown.rs:130 (stale-endpoint removal, minor). Fix: preserve/log the underlying io::Error instead of discarding it, at all 4 sites." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "error-handling" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crate" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-08-03T01:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-S13 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-08-03T01:04:29Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC2> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC3> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC4> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC5> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC6> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC7> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-ERROR-DISCARD/OCC8> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" ;
  triage:progressNote "AI3152-LOCALIPCWAKE-QA-2 (fix/localipcwake-accept-interrupt @ 44f09b37, PR #725): partially fixed. All 4 originally-cited occurrences (OCC1-4) confirmed fixed -- each now uses AtmError::daemon_unavailable_with_cause(..., source) preserving the underlying io::Error via .cause(), independently verified against crates/atm-storage/src/error.rs's with_cause()/cause() implementation and corroborated by rust-best-practices-agent's scope-locked recheck. However, per this finding's repeatable:true / sweepScope:crate, rust-qa-agent's QA-2 sweep of the same reviewed files found 4 additional un-fixed occurrences of the identical discard pattern that were never in the original 4-site scope: local_ipc_transport.rs:718 (thread spawn_scoped for lifecycle waiter), local_ipc_transport/connection_workers.rs:99 (worker thread spawn), local_ipc_transport/request_worker.rs:113 (dispatch worker thread spawn), local_ipc_transport/shutdown.rs:176 and :179 (ready-signal writeln!/flush). I independently verified all 4 via direct source read. Finding remains open pending a fix round covering OCC5-8; do not close." .

